# Seven-axis combined move test (XYZABCE)
# Tests simultaneous multi-axis moves including mixed linear/rotary/extruder

DICTIONARY linuxprocess.dict
CONFIG five_axis.cfg

# Home XYZ and reset all axes to zero
G28 X Y Z
G92 X0 Y0 Z0 A0 B0 C0 E0

# --- Test 1: XY diagonal ---
G1 X100 Y50 F6000
M114

# --- Test 2: X + A combined (linear + rotary) ---
G1 X50 A90 F6000
M114

# --- Test 3: XYZ combined ---
G1 X100 Y50 Z10 F3000
M114

# --- Test 4: A + B combined (pure rotational) ---
G1 A90 B45 F6000
M114

# --- Test 5: A + B + C combined (3-axis rotation) ---
G1 A90 B90 C90 F6000
M114

# --- Test 6: Extruder + rotation ---
G91
G1 E5 A45 F3000
G90
M114

# --- Test 7: Full 7-axis move (all axes simultaneously) ---
G1 X10 Y10 Z5 E5 A45 B45 C45 F3000
M114

GET_POSITION
